# Product scope

- The product has no name. `cafe-finder-prototype` is a repository identifier only. Do not invent a brand or add a logo.
- First coverage is Makati. English UI, `Asia/Manila`, prices in PHP.
- Do not present unknown or unverified café information as fact. Missing hours, menus, prices, amenities, and photos are “Not listed”.
- Show open or closed only from verified hours.
- Location is opt-in and foreground-only. Do not add background tracking or a stored GPS track.
- Do not implement a companion, game mechanics, AR, social features, reviews, reservations, or payments.
- Stay inside the active phase in `docs/STATE.md`. Do not start the next phase without a separate instruction.
- Do not claim a feature or a test exists unless the repository contains it.
